### listar
GET http://localhost:8080/veiculos

### cadastrar
POST http://localhost:8080/veiculos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "placa": "ABC1D23", "modelo": "Gol", "ano": 2020 }

### buscar 
GET http://localhost:8080/veiculos/1

### deletar
DELETE http://localhost:8080/veiculos/1

### atualizar (PUT) - manda tudo
PUT http://localhost:8080/veiculos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "placa": "ABC1D23", "modelo": "Gol G5", "ano": 2021 }

### atualizar parcial (PATCH) - só o ano
PATCH http://localhost:8080/veiculos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ano": 2022 }